  "Specification": "This module specifies the mapping between TLA+ and PlusCal (PCal) code regions, focusing on the syntactic correspondence between regions in the TLA+ specification and their representation in PlusCal. It defines data structures for locations, regions, and translation objects (TPObject), and provides predicates to check well-formedness and ordering of these objects in sequences. The specification includes detailed invariants for matching parentheses, token ordering, and the structure of translation sequences, supporting the correctness of TLA-to-PlusCal translation tools. The design is intended for use in debugging and verifying translation mappings, with additional constructs for simplified debugging scenarios.",
